        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7feab890-bb6e-5afb-aeac-03b0bce956d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Walken, Allison Williams, Taylor Louderman\n- Works: Peter Pan Live!, Peter Pan, The Deer Hunter\n- Organizations: NBC, Academy Awards\n- Places: Grumman Studios, Bethpage, New York\n- Roles: Captain Hook, Wendy, Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Taylor Louderman appeared as Wendy in NBC's live production of the musical \"Peter Pan\".\n- Peter Pan Live! featured a live television production of the 1954 musical adaptation of \"Peter Pan\" from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York.\n- Allison Williams starred in Peter Pan Live! in the title role.\n- Christopher Walken played Captain Hook in Peter Pan Live!.\n- Christopher Walken won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for playing Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich in \"The Deer Hunter.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "96ee631a-10b3-50df-b64f-b6cac0f1ff39",
        "text": "Page: Peter Pan Live!. Sentence: The special featured a live production of the 1954 musical adaptation of \"Peter Pan\", televised from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York, starring Allison Williams in the title role and Christopher Walken as Captain Hook.\nPage: Christopher Walken. Sentence: Walken has received a number of awards and nominations during his career, including winning the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for his portrayal of Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich in \"The Deer Hunter.\"\nPage: Taylor Louderman. Sentence: In 2013, she appeared as Wendy in NBC's live production of the musical \"Peter Pan\".",
